OL,3,AChancellor rejects calls to raise
OL,4,ACapital Gains Tax in Budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FChancellor John Healey has dismissed
OL,7,Fcalls from some Labour MPs to increase
OL,8,FCapital Gains Tax (CGT), according to
OL,9,FTreasury sources.
OL,11,FCabinet ministers Wes Streeting and
OL,12,FLouise Haigh both previously voiced
OL,13,Fsupport for raising CGT before Andy
OL,14,FBurnham became prime minister in July.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
