OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AChancellor rejects calls to raise
OL,4,ACapital Gains Tax in Budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FAhead of next week's Budget, as first
OL,7,Freported by the Times, Healey is minded
OL,8,Fnot to increase CGT - which is imposed
OL,9,Fon the profit people make when they
OL,10,Fsell an asset that has increased in
OL,11,Fvalue, such as shares in a company or
OL,12,Fproperties which are not primary
OL,13,Fresidences.
OL,15,FThe move followed warnings that it
OL,16,Fcould end up costing the government
OL,17,Fmoney if wealthy people leave the
OL,18,Fcountry or defer selling off assets.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
