OL,3,ABurnham vows end to 'rip-off parking
OL,4,Acharges' under new rules
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrivers will be given the right to
OL,7,Fchallenge "rip off" private parking
OL,8,Fcharges and more grace when using
OL,9,Fprivate providers under new rules set
OL,10,Fout by Andy Burnham.
OL,12,FThe Prime Minister announced the
OL,13,Fchanges after drivers repeatedly raised
OL,14,Fconcerns penalties issued by private
OL,15,Fproviders were too harsh and left
OL,16,Fmotorists unfairly penalised.
OL,18,FIn one case, a woman was taken to court
OL,19,Fin a #1,906 claim after taking longer
OL,20,Fthan five minutes to pay at a car park
OL,21,Fin Derby. The charge was eventually
OL,22,Fdropped.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
