OL,3,ACurfew imposed in parts of central
OL,4,AParis and other cities after rioting
OL,5,Aacross France
OL,6,
OL,7,FFrench authorities have imposed
OL,8,Fovernight curfews in parts of central
OL,9,FParis and other cities after a weekend
OL,10,Fof riots and looting across the
OL,11,Fcountry.
OL,13,FPolice in Paris said a curfew would be
OL,14,Fin force between 23:00 local time
OL,15,F(21:00 GMT) and 06:00 in Place de la
OL,16,FRepublique, where protesters had
OL,17,Fgathered over the weekend, and the Les
OL,18,FHalles shopping area.
OL,20,FA ban on unauthorised gatherings has
OL,21,Falso been imposed in several other
OL,22,Fparts of the city centre.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
